<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab fighters captured a village near Mataban, expanding their territorial control in central Somalia. In Minnesota, Somali-American Uber driver Mohamed Yusuf was assaulted, his car stolen and he was run over, leaving him in a coma and prompting a hate-crime investigation. Clashes in Moyale on the Ethiopia-Somalia border disrupted livelihoods as a territorial dispute deepened. The conflict in Somalia produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQX09oeHJVMEswVHNnUXJrdXN0YW90R2d6QURxMXVOVC1HLXk1Z01HUHlRWDA2QTFuTmpUd2xPUnJWTUc1ZjAxS0VaQzhvR3V3U1V2VFhuTVRrQXRpd3E0a0tjYjRiZmNfOWhjYWwtTTkzZnZ4R2lCbXhoNEVJTjhhd0FZQlppZnR1TldCZEdBVG12cUVnSTU1OEZnb1MxOVhZUzJ0ZEwtVjRIQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNRVlZb21WekU5S2lTVWdKeWVNQmduSElhUnZkTExjcG5lNWVZVTVVcW5Qam1NWkFSSDhtQUpuVG5wQnZISWxvcEM0c2c1Q3YtX3pRZkZadlpBelBJVTd3S2tETFIzVUlpLWJHVi1HcThDT3YwSTVXaS1HXzU3SjFEWkFEWFhXSV9wYzN4UEYwbHZ4QURKVnlja0FzclJyeHhySUNFaW1jM3d6QThhZUZTVGNmUThSWnk4dWpCdUVLNXlTZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNeFpKWGRrSWZ3bURCcE9URUo4SDlIQURWbER6TEpwcTRLeld1X1VoTFJtcWRLTFgzNWp3ZVpHeFBDTjEyR3ZtUFpERVJkZDZNNXRBUGFiUjZnYmNuUVRTTTVqZloxd25SM2VmRHFrYnYwcG85Wm15bzFxSHN3ZmRqbWpjOUlSdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxOQ2Q2bWNiSGpBUmtrY0o0eFVTeF9fci1DZmZEREhpc1F5RThfVXBGSUtLTXlwSW5rdlZENlpIS2F2cUppYl9IS29aNF9QYkZiQ0dDLWx0NE5kbTk1b3VzS0lYemwycjRFdy1tdnQ3VVIzX0ZXSG52eFFJRnFQZkNUd19BbENpQk9ER2JXSV9qd1F